### ============================================
### MESSAGING API TESTS
### ============================================

### Send a Message (Replace TOKEN and RECEIVER_ID)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/messages
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YTkxMzEyNTBiOTVlMzdkMDE3YmE5ODIiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODc5MDc2NTcsImV4cCI6MTc5MDQ5OTY1N30.xTRskSoCBsW6Ag480DPy24DBDh6QusnMEs8ECjaTYd8
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "receiverId": "6a9131250b95e37d017ba982",
    "content": "Hello! This is a test message."
}

###

### Get Conversation with Specific User (Replace TOKEN and USER_ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/messages/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Get All Conversations for Current User
GET http://localhost:5000/api/messages/conversations
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Mark Messages as Read (Replace TOKEN and USER_ID)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/messages/read/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Delete a Message (Replace TOKEN and MESSAGE_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/messages/REPLACE_WITH_MESSAGE_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE